-- over cubes (P2.6d, P2.6e begun), as a working copy of lib/nbe.cub. Load in place of lib/nbe.cub:
--   ./build/cubical lib/prelude.cub lib/code.cub lib/match.cub lib/nav.cub lib/cost.cub lib/lin.cub
--     lib/check.cub lib/std.cub experiments/nbe/p26-wip.cub
-- (not with lib/nbe.cub, whose names it reuses; experiments/nbe/examples.cub does not load on it).
