  PathP (λ i → Cube (dims sk2) X) (cmap-cube sk2 sk1 (cmap-of sk2 sk1 r2) X (cmap-cube sk1 sk (cmap-of sk1 sk r1) X c)) (cmap-cube sk2 sk (cmap-of sk2 sk (λ k → r2 (r1 k))) X c)
