pc4-d A B x0 x1 x2 x3 x4 p1 p2 p3 p4 b0 b1 b2 b3 b4 P1 P2 P3 P4 = (pcat-d A B x0 x1 x4 p1 (pcat A x1 x2 x4 p2 (pcat A x2 x3 x4 p3 p4)) b0 b1 b4 P1 (pcat-d A B x1 x2 x4 p2 (pcat A x2 x3 x4 p3 p4) b1 b2 b4 P2 (pcat-d A B x2 x3 x4 p3 p4 b2 b3 b4 P3 P4)))
