DexD sk j j' X F D d = PathP (λ i → DCube (dims sk) X F (diag-exch sk j j' X D i)) (diag-sk-d sk j X F (diag-sk sk j' (Line X) (exc (dims sk) X D)) (diag-sk-d sk j' (Line X) (LineO X F) (exc (dims sk) X D) (exd (dims sk) X F D d))) (diag-sk-d sk j' X F (diag-sk sk j (Line X) D) (diag-sk-d sk j (Line X) (LineO X F) D d))
